# 2) Open a throwaway Chrome profile that resolves erag.com to the tunnel.
## Open a throwaway Chrome profile that resolves erag.com to the tunnel; start erag-tunnel first.
alias erag-chrome='google-chrome --user-data-dir=/tmp/chrome-erag --host-resolver-rules="MAP erag.com 127.0.0.1:8443, MAP *.erag.com 127.0.0.1:8443" --ignore-certificate-errors https://erag.com/'
